                                    <h5><i class="fas fa-clock me-2"></i>Trial Period</h5>
                                    <p>Your 14-day free trial starts immediately after registration. You can upgrade, downgrade, or cancel at any time.</p>
                                    <p class="mb-0"><strong>No credit card required for trial</strong></p>
